##Get Report List

GET:/report/list

###Header
HEADER:Authorization

###Input
INPUT:start_date,required|date, format : YYYY-MM-DD
INPUT:end_date,required|date, format : YYYY-MM-DD
INPUT:page,int, default : 1
INPUT:perpage,int, default : 100

##Error
ERROR:SUCCESS
ERROR:REQUIRE_PARAMETER
ERROR:INVALID_FORMAT
ERROR:PERMISSION_DENIED

###RESULT
JSON:document/report/list
==============================================================

